' Capability / Agentic Capability realization boundary
'
' Per ADR-ES-012 §8 + CR-ES-012 §21.
' Primary architectural model distinguishing Capability from
' Agentic Capability from Realization from Outcome.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml capability-agentic-realization-boundary

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Capability / Agentic Capability Realization Boundary

CAPABILITY : What enduring ability exists?
note right of CAPABILITY
  Universal concept
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

CAPABILITY --> AGENTIC_CAPABILITY : Is the ability materially realized agentically?
note right of AGENTIC_CAPABILITY
  Specialization of Capability
  per ADR-ES-012
end note

AGENTIC_CAPABILITY --> REALIZATION : How is the ability realized?
note right of REALIZATION
  Workflow / Operations / Service / System / Human
end note

REALIZATION --> OUTCOME : What is achieved?

@enduml
